# *Param stuff
# Costs
STR_PARAM_NAME_BASECOSTMODBUY:Purchase costs
STR_PARAM_DESC_BASECOSTMODBUY:Define the purchase costs of vehicle

STR_PARAM_RUN_NAME:Running costs
STR_PARAM_RUN_DESC:Define the running costs of vehicles

STR_PARAM_NAME_CAPACITY:Train capacity
STR_PARAM_DESC_CAPACITY:100% — Commuters have enough personal space and are able to take a seat or stand while holding onto the straps or hand rails.{}150% — Commuters have enough personal space to read a newspaper.{}200% — Commuters are pressed against each other in each compartment but can still read small magazines.{}250% — Commuters are pressed against each other, unable to move.{}Custom — Use if you hate your commuters.{}{WHITE}Select 150% for the best experience{BLACK}

STR_PARAM_VLOW:Very Low
STR_PARAM_LOW:Low
STR_PARAM_NORMAL:Normal
STR_PARAM_HIGH:High
STR_PARAM_VHIGH:Very High
STR_PARAM_REAL:Realistic

# Capacity
STR_PARAM_BOOST_RAPID:Boost low capacity limited express trains
STR_PARAM_BOOST_RAPID_DESC:Optimizes limited express trains' capacity for gameplay.{}0 - 1x, 1 - 1.5x, 2 - 2x and etc.{}For a regular gameplay 1x is enough, as low capacity is backed up with a higher (express) income.

STR_PARAM_HIDE_LOGO:Hide Logos from the purchase menu

STR_PERCENT:{COMMA}%
STR_PARAM_CAP_CUSTOM:Custom

STR_PARAM_CUSTOMCAPACITY:Multiply capacity. Works only if train capacity set to "custom"
STR_PARAM_CUSTOMCAPACITYDESC:Do you hate your commuters so much? Come on, they are unable to move already!

